<title>HONG KONG: Four Seas Merc interim profit up 34 pct.</title>
<headline>Four Seas Merc interim profit up 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.9   vs 8.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0    vs 2.8</p>
